#. module: delivery_fedex_certified
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_fedex_certified.field_delivery_carrier__fedex_certified_residential_address
msgid ""
"Determines whether to mark the recipient address as residential (to "
"correctly calculate any possible surcharges). Please note: when retrieving "
"this information using the FedEx Address API, we assume that the address is "
"residential unless it is marked explicitly as a BUSINESS address."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໝາຍທີ່ຢູ່ຜູ້ຮັບເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ອາໄສຫຼືບໍ່ (ເພື່ອຄຳນວນຄ່າທຳນຽມເພີ່ມເຕີມຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ). ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ: ເມື່"
"ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ FedEx Address API, ລະບົບຈະຖືວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ນັ້ນເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ອາໄສ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈ"
"ນວ່າເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ທຸລະກິດ (BUSINESS)."

