#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_fedex_certified/wizard/account_registration_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"We are unable to process this request.\n"
"Please try again later or call FedEx Customer Service and ask for technical support."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕາມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍນີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ ຫຼື ໂທຫາຝ່າຍບໍລິການລູກຄ້າຂອງ FedEx ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອດ້ານເຕັກນິກ."

#. module: delivery_fedex_certified
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_fedex_certified.field_delivery_carrier__fedex_certified_email_notifications
msgid ""
"When enabled, the customer will receive email notifications from FedEx about"
" this shipment (when an email address is configured on the customer)"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ລູກຄ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມວຈາກ FedEx ກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດສົ່ງນີ້ (ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່"
"ຢູ່ອີເມວໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າ)"

#. module: delivery_fedex_certified
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_fedex_certified.field_delivery_carrier__fedex_certified_override_shipper_vat
msgid ""
"Will be provided to Fedex as primary company tax identifier of type "
"BUSINESS_UNION to put on the generated invoice. Use this when you need to "
"use an IOSS or EORI number in addition to the national tax number. When not "
"provided the regular tax id on the company will be used with type "
"BUSINESS_NATIONAL."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ FedEx ເປັນລະຫັດປະຈຳຕົວຜູ້ເສຍພາສີຫຼັກຂອງບໍລິສັດປະເພດ BUSINESS_UNION ເພື່ອລະບຸໃນໃບ"
"ແຈ້ງໜີ້ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເລກ IOSS ຫຼື EORI ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກເລກປະຈຳຕົວຜູ້ເສຍພາສີແ"
"ຫ່ງຊາດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ, ລະຫັດພາສີປົກກະຕິຂອງບໍລິສັດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນປະເພດ BUSINESS_NATIONAL."

#. module: delivery_fedex_certified
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/delivery_fedex_certified/models/fedex_request.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot proceed with the FedEx API until you have fully agreed to the "
"terms of the FedEx End User Licence Agreement (EULA)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ FedEx API ໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງສັນຍາອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຸດ"
"ທ້າຍຂອງ FedEx (EULA) ຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ."

